<section id="panel-requirements" class="panel">
  <div class="panel-head">
    <h1>Requirements</h1>
    <p>Every requirement the pipeline has ingested — source, quality score, and version history. Read-only: written by the pipeline's own <code>fetch → parse → evaluate_quality</code> chain.</p>
  </div>
  <h2>Requirements
    <span id="req-count" class="d fw-400"></span>
    <button class="dl-btn ml-auto" id="req-refresh">↻</button>
  </h2>
  <div class="glass card mb-14">
    <div id="requirements"><span class="d">No requirements yet — run a pipeline against a <code>github</code>, <code>document</code>, <code>email</code>, <code>transcript</code>, or <code>jira</code> source and they'll collect here.</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="glass card" id="req-detail-card" style="display:none">
    <div class="k flex-row">
      <span id="req-detail-title">—</span>
      <button class="dl-btn ml-auto" id="req-detail-close">✕ close</button>
    </div>
    <div id="req-detail-body" class="mt-10"></div>
  </div>

  <h2>Impact — shared data models &amp; flows</h2>
  <p class="d mt-n6">Requirements grouped by the data models and business flow named in each requirement's latest version. Model edges link entities that co-occur on the same requirement; typed dependencies show explicit Order → Payment edges. Click a requirement id to open its detail above.</p>
  <div class="qa">
    <div class="glass card">
      <div class="k mb-8">By data model</div>
      <div class="feed" id="req-data-models"><span class="d">No shared data models yet.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="glass card">
      <div class="k mb-8">Model edges</div>
      <div class="feed" id="req-model-edges"><span class="d">No co-occurrence edges yet.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="glass card span-2">
      <div class="k mb-8">Typed dependencies</div>
      <div class="feed" id="req-model-deps"><span class="d">No typed Order → Payment edges yet.</span></div>
      <svg id="req-dep-canvas" viewBox="0 0 640 220" width="100%" height="220" aria-label="Dependency graph" style="display:none" class="mt-12"></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="glass card span-2">
      <div class="k mb-8">By flow</div>
      <div class="feed" id="req-flows"><span class="d">No flows tagged yet.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
